Z||000000||8Ball||06-28-2001||03:43 PM||||HEya guys,<P>  I have been lurking and reading on here for a couple days and decided it was time to say hello <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  Just a little about myself, I am a Fiero nut without a Fiero atm. My last one was an 88 gt with a V-8 installed with the V-8 Archie kit. I lowered the car's ride hight by 2 inches and droped in a sbc 350 that was bored .60 over. And talk about haul some rear end that car would go!!!! I am currently trying to save up a few bucks to buy another 86-88 gt. (If I can find a good deal that is) But anyway enuf about me. <P>Glad I finally found this board and looking forward to talking with all of you.||||reg||10
